      "Language": "dan",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Back pain is a typical symptom of abdominal aortic aneurysm. Symptoms of root compression may also be present if the aneurysm has caused changes to the vertebral column. A typical case is presented. The condition is life-threatening and requires vascular reconstruction."},
